WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.100
Adieu, Karin-chan's First Love

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:38.720
I am God!

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.120
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:09.000
I'll have you disappear today, amateur goddess!

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:11.170
Proeli Gradius!

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:14.760
Watch out!!!

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:30.020
Sagitta-{As I said before…}

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:32.020
Kazune-kun, leave it to me!

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:32.940
Karin.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:37.780
The fact that you can't use your abilities at will is excellent.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:41.240
God Thunder!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:42.780
What?

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.160
I did it!

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.960
I'm…

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:53.630
I'm not done yet.

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:56.590
Zombie glasses guy!

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:58.380
I'm not "zombie glasses guy"!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:02:59.140
I'm Karasuma-

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.140
Eh, it doesn't matter!

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.870
Karin-chan, you were awesome!

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:26.080
It looks like you can release your abilities 100% of the time now!

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:30.710
It was nothing, it looks like luck is with me.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:31.830
You're right.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:35.250
Just leave it to me from now on.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.880
Don't get so full of yourself…

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.630
This is bad.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.300
I only transformed…

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:42.470
- Kazune-kun.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.350
- Kazune-chan.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.980
Kazune-kun.

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:59.650
You've become reliable now.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:04.320
Recently, zombie glasses guy has been attacking a lot.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.740
To continue fighting at this pace,…

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.830
Kazune-kun must be exhausted.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.710
Karin-chan, you have to give it even more!

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:20.510
I wonder if Kazune-kun's alright.

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.670
- Good morning. 
- Good morning.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.970
Are you sure you don't want to take a day off?

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.470
You sure are persistent, I told you I was okay.

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:13.270
What's with the attitude? I was just worried.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:17.320
It's okay, Karin-chan.

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.900
Because, this morning Kazune-chan has…

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:23.990
What is it?

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:29.370
…asked for seconds during breakfast and left his green peppers.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:35.880
When he eats two servings, and leaves what he doesn't like,…

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.340
it's proof that Kazune-chan is fine.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:42.010
Huh? Doesn't he like green peppers?

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.920
Be quiet.

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:46.930
That vivid green makes it look like a bug.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:55.400
Himeka-chan sure does know a lot about Kazune-kun.

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.480
- Good morning.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:00.480
- Good morning.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.110
Good morning.

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.900
Good morning, everyone!

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:08.820
What's going on? You sure are energetic this morning, Miyon-chan.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:11.870
Right.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.910
Did something good happen?

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.330
Of course!

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:17.460
Yuki has-

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:20.250
Hey, Miyon, you don't have to tell them.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.880
What is it?

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:22.840
Ta-da!

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:26.590
<u>Poster:</u> Violin Contest Meetup.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:28.970
A violin contest?

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:33.850
Yuki has passed the preliminary selections.

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:36.980
That's great.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:37.900
Well done.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.480
Thanks.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.650
Even though I passed, it was my second try.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:47.070
Even though I was sure Yuki would get in on his first try.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:48.910
It isn't that simple.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.330
Well, well, that's wonderful!

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:52.990
Micchi.

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:57.000
People can do different things with the different talents they have.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.830
Isn't that wonderful?

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.420
Right, Kazune-kun?

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:05.550
In order to get accepted to a music school,…

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:08.720
he's practicing his practical skills and the piano!

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:12.220
So he isn't going to go to our high school.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:14.850
I don't know whether or not I'll pass yet.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.270
What are you saying?

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.730
You'll definitely pass!

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:20.770
Because I'm looking forward to it!

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:23.900
Anyway, do your best!

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.360
Thanks.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:30.280
Miyon, it's our turn to get the copies needed for class.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.120
Ah, I forgot!

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:41.120
Even though Yuki-kun's probably going to a different school, she's so happy.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.040
I wonder if Miyon-chan won't get lonely.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:46.920
She is probably happier about the fact that,…

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:50.930
Sakurai would prefer to be going to a music school.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.060
To be happy even though they're apart,…

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:56.430
does such a thing happen?

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.770
She'll be sad when the time comes.

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:01.440
But isn't that what love is all about?

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:08.030
Sakurai-kun is also trying to respond to Miyon-chan's feelings.

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:13.320
She believes in Sakurai-kun's talent.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:20.160
I believe in him.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:25.630
Kazune-chan has never betrayed my trust.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.090
"Believe".

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.440
Himeka-chan and Miyon-chan.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:45.730
Because they both know so much about their loved ones,…

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:48.070
they have that much confidence in them.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.200
Kirika-senpai.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:06.710
I wonder how much I know of Kirika-senpai.

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.300
Are you worried about something?

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:12.590
Shii-chan!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.880
Why are you at school?

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:18.350
I'm always near my partner to protect her.

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:22.940
Partners can tell each other anything.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:33.200
I see, you're wondering how much you know of the person you love.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.700
You can easily tell!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:37.910
What should I do?

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:43.000
Try thinking of good attributes of the person you love.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:44.830
Good attributes?

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:48.540
The more you can think up, the more you know about him!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:52.920
He has too many good attributes!

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:57.600
Let's say, Kirika-senpai's cool, kind, amazing and…

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.430
Let's say, Kirika-senpai's cool, kind, amazing and…

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.180
Let's say, Kirika-senpai's cool, kind, amazing and…

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:02.770
Let's say, Kirika-senpai's cool, kind, amazing and…

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.650
That's all!!!

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:11.980
No-no-no, that's not true.

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:14.110
I should know more!

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:19.280
Let's see, Kirika-senpai looks good in his uniform, and in casual clothes, and in a yukata…

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.490
Let's see, Kirika-senpai looks good in his uniform, and in casual clothes, and in a yukata…

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:24.620
Let's see, Kirika-senpai looks good in his uniform, and in casual clothes, and in a yukata…

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.590
I can only think about how he looks!!!

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.340
It shouldn't be like this.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:35.010
I should know more of his charms.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:40.300
So, Kirika-senpai's cooler than glasses guy, kinder than glasses guy, more dreamy than glasses guy…

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:43.100
So, Kirika-senpai's cooler than glasses guy, kinder than glasses guy, more dreamy than glasses guy…

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:46.270
So, Kirika-senpai's cooler than glasses guy, kinder than glasses guy, more dreamy than glasses guy…

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:55.570
That just means glasses guy is someone I don't like!!!

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:57.700
Conclusion: Karin-chan knows nothing about the person she loves.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:01.580
Conclusion: Karin-chan knows nothing about the person she loves.

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:07.330
By the way, who is this loved one?

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:11.740
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:15.280
I am God!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.240
You moron.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:20.240
It's a croquette!

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:24.310
I have to learn more about Kirika-senpai.

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.120
What are you doing?

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:52.250
K-Kazune-kun?

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.750
Are you stupid?

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:01.140
I don't know what you're thinking about Karasuma Kirika.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:03.430
Don't get too close to him.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.640
W-What was that?

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:09.480
Kirika-senpai's mysterious aspects are beautiful!

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.020
He isn't childish, rough and thick-headed like you.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:15.480
He doesn't hate bugs, he isn't obstinate, and wasn't a crybaby when he was young.

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:19.320
He's really kind, doesn't say awful things, doesn't cry in a hot spring,…

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.840
and he's not the same as someone who collapses during a fight!

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:32.830
Why do I know so much about Kazune-kun?

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:34.840
Karin.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:38.090
What's wrong with her?

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:45.430
You've been ignoring my orders to not get close to the amateur goddess, right?

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.510
You were watching me?

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:50.770
When you invited her into a secluded space, it could've been a chance to attack.

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:56.270
I don't like tricking people like that.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:59.570
Kirika, what do you mean by that?

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:00.940
Are you disobeying me?

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:03.360
I'm scared.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:08.200
You've recently been attacking Kujyou-kun and the others without any care for your appearance.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.790
You're not choosing any method!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.660
We don't have the time to be selecting our methods.

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:14.000
You should know this.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.080
You're too serious.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.920
If we continue like this, something bad will happen.

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:20.210
Kirika!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.760
I'm worried about you.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:26.720
It's only obvious that I'm concerned about family, right?

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:30.100
The person we have to be concerned about is Himeka!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.140
The person we have to be concerned about is Himeka!

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.640
I understand.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.100
You don't understand!

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:38.400
You're too easy-going, getting all friendly with the amateur goddess!

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:40.110
After all-

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.030
Wait, Kirika!

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:50.580
If you leave here now…

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:57.500
I'll have to finish all the work alone!

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:15.850
Why do I know more about Kazune-kun than about my beloved Kirika-senpai?

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:23.820
I see.

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.950
Of course, it's because…

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.990
I live together with Kazune-kun!

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:33.200
When you think about it, I heard half from Himeka-chan.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:35.120
Ah, I feel relieved.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.830
Kirika-senpai is the one for me after all.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.340
I understand.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:48.660
I'll leave it to you.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.190
Karin-chan.

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.860
Y-You found me.

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:10.700
Um… Kirika-senpai.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:18.370
It's best if you don't follow me around anymore.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.920
Of course, you're right.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:28.260
If we're going to be together, we should try to do it better.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:30.390
That's not it, Karin-chan.

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:36.060
I'm wrong, right? Yes, I'm wrong. This is a mistake.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.350
Excuse me!

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:47.490
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:48.990
There is something I want to ask you.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:51.870
You always show me such a scary face.

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.870
Don't attack me all of a sudden.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:55.870
I'm serious.

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.580
…and then…

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:04.670
"Follow me" and "Go out with me" are said the same in Japanese.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:02.040
We're changing location, follow me.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:04.670
"Go out with me", is that a confession?

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:13.220
Kirika-senpai hates me.

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:14.220
He hates me!

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:22.560
That's right, I'm just like a stalker.

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:26.690
I must've been a bother.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.280
That's not it, Karin-chan.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.200
Kirika-senpai.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:36.290
What was he trying to say?

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:39.710
I'm always like this.

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:43.250
Judging a situation just after seeing or hearing something…

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:48.010
even though he might've had something to tell me.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:55.260
It's because of that I looked like an idiot in front of Kirika-senpai, and I didn't understand him.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:17:00.140
I'll thoroughly listen to what Kirika-senpai has to say.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:03.560
I have to understand the feelings of the person I love.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:07.070
Just like Himeka-chan and Miyon-chan.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:13.530
Karin-chan, I'm sorry.

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:22.330
Whatever I say, I just end up hurting you.

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:26.960
Your heart is surrounded in fog.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.960
It's painful, isn't it?

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:36.260
Karasuma Kirika-sama.

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:38.680
You are?

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.900
Who are you?

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:54.990
Kirika-senpai?

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:13.970
He's with another girl!!!

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:16.930
What does this mean? What does this mean?!

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.510
What does this mean? What does this mean?!

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:21.060
Who is that girl?!

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:25.560
Knowing everything about your loved one means,…

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:30.360
that you should know the things that you don't want to know, too. Right?

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.530
What are you to me?

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:39.580
The fog will surely clear away.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:45.080
You just have to think of the sun in your heart.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:48.000
Wait a minute, who are you?

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:49.290
Kazusa.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:51.130
I'm Kazusa.

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:53.720
Who was that?

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:54.670
I have no idea.

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:04.270
"The fog will clear"?

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:14.780
Even though I was so close to Kirika-senpai…

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:17.900
Was that girl his girlfriend?

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:23.660
But when you think about it, it's not that surprising.

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:28.000
Senpai's so cool, he should have one or two girlfriends…

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:35.760
Adieu! My love!

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:38.470
Karin.

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:41.300
Happy people should go away!

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.470
What's wrong with you?

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:47.810
I'm just a lonely single person.

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:49.190
What happened?

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:53.230
Be worried about Himeka-chan instead of me!!!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.360
Leave me alone!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:01.120
Fine, I'm going.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:06.370
Hanazono-san, why are you crying?

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:07.370
She's fine.

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:08.830
Hanazono-san!

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.290
Let her be!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.000
You sure are kind…

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:22.680
You said you got your ring from my father, right?

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:24.220
Yes.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.640
Won't you let me investigate?

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.850
This ring?

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:34.360
I want to find out if that ring is real.

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:38.360
You want to know if this ring has godly powers or not?

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:45.450
What if I said no?

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:46.950
I'll borrow it by force.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:49.870
By force? I wouldn't say borrow then.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:56.800
I had an argument with him again.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.340
Even though it's not Kazune-kun's fault.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.340
I should apologise.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:09.930
Fine.

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.140
Try investigating it.

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:17.020
That's weird. I'm sure they went this way.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:18.690
But there's a condition.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:19.650
A condition?

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:25.410
This is my precious ring, if I lend it to you, I want some insurance.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:26.830
Insurance?

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:27.660
Yes.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:29.660
What do you want?

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:33.120
This seems to be a hard to talk atmosphere.

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:37.460
I want to know your secret.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:38.550
You already know.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:42.220
As expected from the "child of god transformation" Kazune-kun.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:46.760
But it seems you haven't perfected it yet.

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:54.020
Ah, but I promised not to talk to anyone else about that at the hot spring.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:55.520
What?

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:56.520
What are they talking about?

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:58.610
Then, what do you want to know?

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:01.530
Let's see…

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:05.490
Who is the person you love?

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.870
What is this all of a sudden?

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:10.740
In short, it's Hanazono-san, right?

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:14.120
What're you saying, Micchi?

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:16.250
There's no way Kazune-kun would lo-

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:17.210
You're right.

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:28.800
It's Karin.

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.600
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.600
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.130
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.130
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.370
A Lovely Date with Kazune-kun!?

00:24:06.070 --> 00:24:07.800
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.860
A lovely date with Kazune-kun!?

00:24:11.240 --> 00:24:15.660
Eh, I heard Kazune-kun's sudden confession!

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:19.290
A lovely date, it can't be!
